     the neutral variant palette at tone 17 (MDC 1.12.0 values-v31/tokens.xml:48 →
     color-v31/m3_ref_palette_dynamic_neutral_variant17.xml:18) – system_neutral2_600 re-lit to
     L* 17 – at Chrome's 0.9 over the wallpaper, the alpha on the fill alone. -->
<selector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
